'''Chroma Slasher''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is black in color and curved with sharp edges. Engraved in the blade are chromatic beams and specs. The guard is black with three chromatic specs, and the handle is also black with bright chromatic beams. Attached to the bottom of the handle is the pointed red pommel.

== Trivia ==
*It is the [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Slasher]], which can be found in the same box.
*Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/287424278/Orinthian-Electroslasher Orinthian Electroslasher], purchasable from the avatar shop for 500 Robux. However, it was retextured by [[Thexz]], altering it from a bright blue color to a color alternating texture.
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.
*It was released along with the [[Season 1]] update.
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Chroma Laser]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma_Slasher_Set Chroma Slasher Set].
*Like many other [[Chroma Weapons]], it lost a lot of [[value]] due to being [[The Duping Glitch (2021)|duped]].

